### WHAT NOT TO PUT ON THIS PAGE

No navigation menu. No exit links. No chat widget. No India or Indian clothing references anywhere. No mention of AI — use "ICONIK Methodology" and "your Blueprint" instead. No testimonials yet — add them in Month 2 once you have Australian buyers.
